[04/17 17:56:55     17s] Applying the recommended capacitance filtering threshold values for 180nm process node: total_c_th=5, relative_c_th=0.03 and coupling_c_th=3.
[04/17 17:56:55     17s] 	These values will be used by all post-route extraction engines, including TQuantus, IQuantus and Quantus QRC extraction.
[04/17 17:56:55     17s] 	For post_route extract_rc_effort_level low extraction, the coupling_c_th value will be used only when the extract_rc_cap_filter_mode parameter of the set_db command is set to relative_and_coupling or relative_or_coupling. Default value of extract_rc_cap_filter_mode parameter in post_route extraction extract_rc_effort_level low is relative_only.
[04/17 17:56:55     17s] 	The accuracy mode for post_route extract_rc_effort_level low extraction will be set to 'standard'.
[04/17 17:56:55     17s] 	Default value for EffortLevel(extract_rc_effort_level option of the set_db) in post_route extraction mode is 'low'.
